What's new in this Version:

* Initial NVIDIA GPU support for accelerated applications
* Rebase Blender, Chromium, Dolphin, Firefox, GIMP, Krita, melonDS, RetroArch, and Telegram to glibc based distros for acceleration
* Add Resolute base image
* Rebase Bookworm images to Trixie and stop building unused bases
* New apps: AWS WorkSpaces Client, Brave Origin, Helium browser, OpenCloud desktop client, OrcaSlicer, WeChat
* Add Selkies gamepad interposers to base images
* Add base locales to images
* Add icon theme and swap app icons to SVG
* Fixes for Brave launch, OnlyOffice install, Telegram icon, Obsidian desktop file, and WineGUI in Docker
